{
  "name": "TikTok Carousel — Path A (TikTok API direto, pós-audit)",
  "_comentario": "MESMO fluxo do workflow B até 'Agrega URLs'. A diferença é o último bloco: em vez de chamar upload-post.com, chama TikTok Content Posting API (init + publish). Importar este workflow SOMENTE depois que o audit do TikTok aprovar o app. Os 12 primeiros nós são idênticos ao workflow B — copie deles na hora de importar e substitua só o bloco de publicação por estes 3 nós:",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://open.tiktokapis.com/v2/post/publish/content/init/",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN }}" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"post_info\": {\n    \"title\": \"{{ $('Validar + normalizar').first().json.titulo }}\",\n    \"description\": \"{{ $('Validar + normalizar').first().json.caption }}\",\n    \"privacy_level\": \"SELF_ONLY\",\n    \"disable_comment\": false,\n    \"auto_add_music\": true\n  },\n  \"source_info\": {\n    \"source\": \"PULL_FROM_URL\",\n    \"photo_cover_index\": 0,\n    \"photo_images\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.urls) }}\n  },\n  \"post_mode\": \"DIRECT_POST\",\n  \"media_type\": \"PHOTO\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "tiktok-init",
      "name": "TikTok · init+publish",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2880, 320],
      "notes": "Inicia E publica o photo carousel direto (DIRECT_POST). privacy_level deve ser SELF_ONLY até o app passar pelo audit; depois pode usar 'PUBLIC_TO_EVERYONE'. Retorna publish_id."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 8,
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "wait-publish",
      "name": "Aguarda 8s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [3120, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://open.tiktokapis.com/v2/post/publish/status/fetch/",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN }}" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={ \"publish_id\": \"{{ $('TikTok · init+publish').first().json.data.publish_id }}\" }",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "tiktok-status",
      "name": "TikTok · status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [3360, 320]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "TikTok · init+publish": { "main": [[{ "node": "Aguarda 8s", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Aguarda 8s": { "main": [[{ "node": "TikTok · status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  },
  "_referencia_oauth": "Pra renovar o access token automaticamente, criar workflow auxiliar: POST https://open.tiktokapis.com/v2/oauth/token/ com grant_type=refresh_token, client_key, client_secret, refresh_token. Rodar daily às 07:00 e salvar novo access_token nas variáveis do n8n.",
  "_referencia_scopes": "OAuth scopes necessários: video.upload, video.publish (sim, ambos servem pra photo post também).",
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "versionId": "0.1.0"
}
